# Copy

- Tone: neutral, descriptive, clear, informative.
- No marketing accentuation: no hype adjectives, slogans, urgency tricks, or exaggerated claims.
- Prefer concrete facts about what the product does and who it helps.
- Keep ES and EN meaning aligned; do not invent benefits in one locale only.
- When copy changes, log a short note in `docs/design-learning.md`.
